    "United Kingdom - English",
    "Cargo Insurance Services Cargo Insurance Services Get a Quote Connectivity Tools",
    "Claims",
    "Resources Resources Customer Stories Insights Help & Support",
    "About About Product Availability Contact Us",
    "Managing shipping risks doesn’t have to be complicated. InsureShield® helps protect your shipments during transit, giving you confidence and peace of mind while you focus on growing your business.",
    "Quote",
    "Based on your needs, we’ll provide a policy structure and quote for your shipping insurance.",
    "Protect",
    "We offer multi-carrier coverage, so you can ship via UPS or other carriers with protection tailored to your business. Multi-modal coverage is available for packaging travelling by road, air or ocean.",
    "Integrate",
    "Use our API or webhooks to automate insurance through your e-commerce platforms, or handle everything through our online portal.",
    "Claim",
    "Our dedicated claims team works efficiently to help you recover eligible losses quickly, when needed.",
    "We know shipping, freight and supply chains. That’s why you get policies designed to address today’s logistics challenges.",
    "Simplify Claim Handling File claims online with our paperless process, with approved claims paid up to the invoice value of the goods, plus shipping expenses. Making Cargo Claims",
    "Simplify Claim Handling",
    "File claims online with our paperless process, with approved claims paid up to the invoice value of the goods, plus shipping expenses.",
    "Making Cargo Claims",
    "Win Over Customers Issue a refund or replace a package with the knowledge that your shipments are covered by InsureShield. More Resources for our Customers",
    "Win Over Customers",
    "Issue a refund or replace a package with the knowledge that your shipments are covered by InsureShield.",
    "More Resources for our Customers",
    "90 Days to Report Concealed Damage You have up to 90 days after delivery to report hidden damage, giving you and your customers time to inspect shipments thoroughly.",
    "90 Days to Report Concealed Damage",
    "You have up to 90 days after delivery to report hidden damage, giving you and your customers time to inspect shipments thoroughly.",
    "Comprehensive Protection Across Carriers Safeguard your cargo across multiple carriers and transport modes, while saving time by avoiding complex carrier comparisons. Find Out More",
    "Comprehensive Protection Across Carriers",
    "Safeguard your cargo across multiple carriers and transport modes, while saving time by avoiding complex carrier comparisons.",
    "Find Out More",
    "Digital Tools for Smarter Shipping Protection",
    "Insurance API Integration: Connect InsureShield® cargo insurance directly to your website or internal systems for automated coverage and claims management.",
    "Smart Upload: Easily upload batch files through the InsureShield® Online Portal to simplify bulk shipment protection.",
    "E-commerce Webhooks: Integrate with platforms like Shopify or ShipStation – no coding required – for fast, hassle-free insurance activation.",
    "Shipping thousands of parcels across borders comes with some risks. At InsureShield®, we work with e-commerce businesses and manufacturers every day to simplify cargo insurance. Our mission is to make shipping insurance clear, practical, and tailored to your business needs, so you can protect your shipments and maintain customer trust. From manufacturers to e-commerce, we serve businesses across various industries.",
    "Cargo Insurance Costs Insights",
    "Claims Best Practices",
    "Carrier Liability vs Cargo Insurance",
    "Discover real examples of businesses that recovered from shipping-related losses with InsureShield® cargo insurance. Learn how our tailored shipping protection helps companies safeguard high-value goods, reduce financial risk, and maintain customer trust.",
    "“The power of UPS Capital’s name, their mission and quality of coverage give customers peace of mind that they are protected.”",
    "- William “Bill” Alcorn, Founder and President BikeFlights",
    "Let’s discuss what the best options are for your business.",
    "Customer case studies and testimonials may describe or relate to insurance services offered by a UPS Capital affiliate in another jurisdiction and may not be indicative of insurance services available to you.",
    "Insurance is underwritten by an authorised insurance company and issued through UPS Capital Insurance Agency Limited. UPS Capital Insurance Agency Limited is registered with Companies House (the Registrar of Companies for England and Wales) with UK establishment number 11641767. UPS Capital Insurance Agency Limited’s registered office address is 2 Lotus Park, The Causeway, Staines-Upon-Thames, Middlesex, TW18 3AG, United Kingdom. UPS Capital Insurance Agency Limited is an appointed representative of Crispin Speers & Partners Limited, which is authorised and regulated by the Financial Conduct Authority, FRN 311507. UPS Capital Insurance Agency Limited reserves the right to change or cease to offer any insurance solution described in this communication at any time. The insurance is governed by the terms, conditions, limitations and exclusions set forth in the applicable insurance policy. This website does not in any way alter, supplement, or amend the terms, conditions, limitations or exclusions of the applicable insurance policy. Please consult the insurance policy for the exact terms and conditions. We endeavour to ensure that all information provided on this website is correct. However, no warranty, guarantee, or representation, either express or implied, is made as to the correctness, completeness or timeliness of any information contained herein. Insurance coverage may not be available in all jurisdictions.",
